  <question type="stack">
    <name>
      <text>Matrices : Trace d'une matrice (3×3)</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<div style="background: #475569; border-left: 5px solid #334155; border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0; padding: 10px 16px; margin-bottom: 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap;"><strong style="font-weight: 800; color: #fff; font-size: .95rem;">Matrices — Trace</strong> <span style="background: #334155; color: #fff; padding: 2px 9px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: .78rem; font-weight: bold;">/ 1 pt</span></div>
<p>Soit la matrice :</p>
<div style="text-align: center; margin: 15px 0;">\(M = {@M@}\)</div>
<p><strong>Calculer</strong> la trace de \(M\).</p>
<div style="margin: 10px 0;">\(\text{tr}(M) = \) [[input:ans_tr]] [[validation:ans_tr]]</div>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
    <generalfeedback format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<div style="margin-top: 20px; padding: 15px; background: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 8px;">
<div style="font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 10px;">🔑 Correction détaillée</div>
<div style="font-size: .9rem;">
La <strong>trace</strong> d'une matrice carrée est la somme des coefficients de sa <strong>diagonale principale</strong> :<br><br>
\[
\text{tr}(M) = a_{11} + a_{22} + a_{33}
\]<br>
<strong>Application :</strong><br><br>
\[
\text{tr}(M) = {@a11@} + {@a22@} + {@a33@} = {@trace_correct@}
\]<br><br>
<em style="color: #64748b;">Propriétés utiles : \(\text{tr}(A + B) = \text{tr}(A) + \text{tr}(B)\) &nbsp;et&nbsp; \(\text{tr}(\lambda A) = \lambda\,\text{tr}(A)\).</em>
</div>
</div>]]></text>
    </generalfeedback>
    <defaultgrade>1</defaultgrade>
    <penalty>0.1</penalty>
